          <p>This is really just for my future reference, but since I had a hard time finding out here are the settings I used for w.Bloggar and Community Server 2.0 API Section Blog Tool/API: (Custom) Account Alias: Ryan @ CromwellHaus.com Ping: Weblogs.com API Server: www.cromwellhaus.com Path: /cs/blogs/ryanc/MetaBlog.ashx Custom Section Posts:: metaWeblog API Categories: metaWeblog API &#8211; [...]</p>

