           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/personal/" title="View all posts in Personal" rel="category tag">Personal</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2006/01/new-year-goals-refresh/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on New Year Goals refresh&#8230;"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="645 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2006/01/05/33.aspx">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
